---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro"
---

<SiteLayout
  title="replicad-web-cad"
  description="Browser-based parametric CAD prototype."
>
  <section
    class="rounded-2xl border border-border-card bg-panel p-5 shadow-card"
  >
    <p class="mb-4 text-muted">Browser-only CAD prototype</p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight">
      用瀏覽器建立並匯出方塊模型
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-normal">
      調整方塊的寬、深、高，立即查看 3D 預覽，並下載由精確 B-Rep 產生的 STEP。
    </p>
    <p class="mb-0">
      <a class="text-ink underline underline-offset-4" href="/cad/"
        >開啟 CAD workspace →</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
